#ASSERT `the cell on` 100 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) (LIST `the 2011 table update`) EQUALS 102.25
#ASSERT `the annexed tables are updated from` EQUALS `the allocation starts on`
#ASSERT count `all thirty tables` EQUALS 30

